      "writtenOn": "2023-03-09T18:07:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I can explain why this CL caused the issue. While I do agree with Chris that the true culprit is somewhere else, this CL actually causes the sys control block for AV to deregister before the AV stream blocks are cleared.\n\nWe found ` bta_sys_event: Ignoring receipt of unregistered event id:Advanced audio/video` showing that bta_sys_events couldn\u0027t be processed.",
      "parentUuid": "f4b201e5_3f0f4055",
      "revId": "9e47debbd3c4dc0be26784d28bd582bdc83caff3",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
